    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "新手最高频报错的两处",
      "items": [
        "漏了 AlignmentA/AlignmentB:编译不过",
        "GemmUniversal 第一实参必须是 ProblemShape,不是 TileShape"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Auto 必须配套",
      "items": [
        "mainloop 用 KernelScheduleAuto,epilogue 也要 EpilogueScheduleAuto",
        "不配套会在编译期报模板不匹配",
        "大 epilogue 需要 StageCountAutoCarveout 从 smem 里 carve out"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "从哪个示例抄",
